  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollo bajo en carbono, resiliente al clima e inclusivo en las cuencas del Lago Yojoa en Honduras</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low-carbon, Climate-Resilient, and Inclusive Development in Lake Yojoa Watersheds in Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir a un desarrollo resiliente, bajo en carbono e inclusivo en la cuenca del Lago de Yojoa. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) promover la adopcin de tecnologas y prcticas (CI) yo agroecolgicas por parte de MiPYME; y (ii) promover la adopcin de tecnologas o prcticas de cobertura forestal yo restauracin de suelo por parte de actores clave de la zona de intervencin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to contribute to resilient, low-carbon, and inclusive development in the Lake Yojoa basin. The specific objectives are: (i) promote the adoption of climate-smart (CI) andor agroecological technologies and practices by MSMEs; and (ii) promote the adoption of forest cover andor soil restoration technologies or practices by key stakeholders in the intervention area.</narrative>
  </description>
